1
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,270
♪I stretch and yawn
when the sun is high in the sky♪

2
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:23,030
♪A cup of tea and a little tune,
what a carefree life♪

3
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:28,480
♪The fortune teller said
love would come my way this year♪

4
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:32,580
♪But all I see is my food
arriving right on time♪

5
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,670
♪No rush, no worries♪

6
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:38,360
♪Love is all a matter of chance♪

7
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,480
♪Flowers bloom and fade♪

8
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,380
♪I'd rather take good care
of myself first♪

9
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,580
♪Two orioles sing among
the green willows♪

10
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,970
♪And I still don't have a boyfriend♪

11
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,590
♪My best years are nothing
to worry about♪

12
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,240
♪I'll stay happily single
till I'm old and gray♪

13
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:07,540
=Besties' Coming Fortune=

14
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,980
=Episode 11=

15
00:01:10,230 --> 00:01:10,840
Shen Wanwan.

16
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:13,150
Do you dare roll up your sleeve

17
00:01:13,510 --> 00:01:14,640
and show everyone your wrist?

18
00:01:17,070 --> 00:01:17,480
Oh.

19
00:01:17,950 --> 00:01:18,560
That's it?

20
00:01:19,430 --> 00:01:19,760
Hmph.

21
00:01:20,150 --> 00:01:20,890
That's it?

22
00:01:21,230 --> 00:01:22,060
That's it?

23
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:24,400
That's...

24
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:24,840
That's it?

25
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:26,200
What do you mean, "That's it?"

26
00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:27,310
Shen Wanwan.

27
00:01:28,040 --> 00:01:29,510
Do you dare roll up your sleeve?

28
00:01:36,070 --> 00:01:36,680
What...

29
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:37,230
What are you doing?

30
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:39,480
Why are you so nervous?

31
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,480
Didn't you want to see a wrist?

32
00:01:42,230 --> 00:01:42,840
Here.

33
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:44,310
Take a good look.

34
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:45,760
Your Ladyship.

35
00:01:46,230 --> 00:01:46,560
This...

36
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:47,590
Could the woman in the painting

37
00:01:47,710 --> 00:01:48,840
actually be Her Ladyship?

38
00:01:49,350 --> 00:01:49,920
What a coincidence.

39
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:51,560
I have that birthmark too.

40
00:01:53,150 --> 00:01:54,390
What a coincidence.

41
00:01:54,640 --> 00:01:55,790
So do I.

42
00:01:56,230 --> 00:01:57,070
Me too.

43
00:01:57,070 --> 00:01:57,950
- Me too.
- Me too.

44
00:01:58,280 --> 00:01:59,000
Me too.

45
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:00,230
- Me too.
- Me too.

46
00:02:00,430 --> 00:02:01,230
Why does everyone have it?

47
00:02:08,610 --> 00:02:09,670
How do you explain that?

48
00:02:14,210 --> 00:02:15,180
Are you people out of your minds?

49
00:02:15,430 --> 00:02:16,640
What a coincidence.

50
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:18,200
I have one too.

51
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:19,880
So does he.

52
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:21,320
How could he have one?

53
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:22,640
You

54
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,230
didn't paint me, did you?

55
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:25,750
Pei Qian.

56
00:02:25,750 --> 00:02:26,600
You really are twisted.

57
00:02:27,310 --> 00:02:28,150
If you've got a crush on me,

58
00:02:28,150 --> 00:02:29,200
you should've said so.

59
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:37,480
So what if I have that birthmark?

60
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:39,080
What does that prove?

61
00:02:39,470 --> 00:02:40,390
You're all fighting to claim

62
00:02:40,750 --> 00:02:41,830
something so disgraceful?

63
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,110
Does your family have no shame?

64
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,760
What gives you the right to think

65
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:46,120
you can simply make an accusation

66
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:46,920
with a painting

67
00:02:47,470 --> 00:02:48,710
and condemn someone?

68
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,200
By your logic,

69
00:02:50,910 --> 00:02:52,790
if I painted you harassing a sow,

70
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,080
would you have to

71
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,510
marry it in a grand procession?

72
00:02:56,710 --> 00:02:59,310
And if I painted you
as a thousand-year-old turtle,

73
00:02:59,310 --> 00:03:00,400
would you have to reveal your true form

74
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:02,040
and give everyone a good laugh?

75
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:04,240
A single painting cannot determine

76
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:05,670
anyone's innocence.

77
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:07,600
But your actions

78
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:09,240
are more than worthy

79
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,320
of public disgrace.

80
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,120
Using such despicable methods

81
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:12,830
to prey on women,

82
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:13,990
you're not just a criminal.

83
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,160
- You're an...
- You're an...

84
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:16,440
- Animal.
- Animal.

85
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:18,360
You...

86
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:26,110
How dare you disrespect Her Ladyship?

87
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:27,080
This arrow

88
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:27,790
is just a warning.

89
00:03:28,910 --> 00:03:29,670
The next one

90
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:30,760
won't miss.

91
00:03:34,030 --> 00:03:34,640
What are you going to do?

92
00:03:38,470 --> 00:03:38,990
Let me go.

93
00:03:39,630 --> 00:03:40,160
Let me go.

94
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,670
Who's in this painting?

95
00:03:46,710 --> 00:03:47,600
If I have to suffer,

96
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:48,880
you'll suffer too.

97
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:50,710
It's you people

98
00:03:51,190 --> 00:03:52,600
who make these women live in shame.

99
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:54,430
Whose daughter is this?

100
00:03:54,430 --> 00:03:55,320
How shameless.

101
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:56,680
If someone had painted me

102
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:57,440
in such an indecent portrait,

103
00:03:57,750 --> 00:03:58,710
I'd have drowned myself long ago.

104
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,670
Exactly.

105
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:02,640
Even if she lives, she should hide away.

106
00:04:03,030 --> 00:04:04,320
What a disgrace to her ancestors.

107
00:04:05,500 --> 00:04:07,630
(Shen Manor)

108
00:04:07,630 --> 00:04:08,670
A woman's honor

109
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:10,480
has never depended on such paintings.

110
00:04:11,470 --> 00:04:12,550
Their lives

111
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:14,440
shouldn't be ruined by rumors.

112
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:17,510
The ones who deserve condemnation

113
00:04:17,750 --> 00:04:19,350
aren't these innocent women
who've been humiliated,

114
00:04:19,870 --> 00:04:21,150
but those who exploit
intimate relationships,

115
00:04:21,750 --> 00:04:22,750
make malicious accusations,

116
00:04:22,750 --> 00:04:23,430
deliberately inflict harm,

117
00:04:23,430 --> 00:04:25,120
and disgrace innocent women.

118
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,150
That painting...

119
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:37,830
I'm the woman in that painting.

120
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,270
Three years ago,

121
00:04:41,430 --> 00:04:42,930
he tricked me into posing for it.

122
00:04:43,830 --> 00:04:44,950
He threatened to display my portrait

123
00:04:45,190 --> 00:04:46,940
all over the city unless I paid him.

124
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:49,200
I didn't dare tell my family,

125
00:04:49,760 --> 00:04:50,980
nor did I dare report him
to the authorities.

126
00:04:52,240 --> 00:04:53,390
For three whole years,

127
00:04:53,870 --> 00:04:55,440
I haven't slept peacefully
for a single night.

128
00:04:58,630 --> 00:04:59,120
So this

129
00:04:59,510 --> 00:05:01,240
is what it feels like
to be free of fear.

130
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:09,000
Take a good look.

131
00:05:10,070 --> 00:05:11,000
This is what he used

132
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:11,830
to threaten me.

133
00:05:12,310 --> 00:05:13,150
It's just a painting.

134
00:05:13,950 --> 00:05:14,910
Just a worthless painting.

135
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:22,710
Me too.

136
00:05:25,950 --> 00:05:26,440
I'm in one too.

137
00:05:33,980 --> 00:05:37,700
(Shen Manor)

138
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:42,830
I'm the woman in this painting.

139
00:05:43,510 --> 00:05:44,470
Starting today,

140
00:05:46,310 --> 00:05:46,910
I'm not afraid anymore.

141
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:54,590
It's really happening.

142
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:05,320
Good riddance.

143
00:06:05,950 --> 00:06:07,310
- Good.
- Good.

144
00:06:07,310 --> 00:06:10,390
- Good riddance.
- Good riddance.

145
00:06:10,870 --> 00:06:12,320
Good.

146
00:06:13,070 --> 00:06:13,680
Arrest him.

147
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:14,350
He deserves to be arrested.

148
00:06:15,250 --> 00:06:15,780
Good riddance.

149
00:06:29,660 --> 00:06:34,540
(Song Zhang)

150
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:37,240
Your Lordship.

151
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:39,200
I've finally found you.

152
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:42,640
Wait a minute.

153
00:06:44,390 --> 00:06:45,630
That line, the slow motion,

154
00:06:45,630 --> 00:06:46,470
and that dramatic entrance...

155
00:06:46,750 --> 00:06:48,080
Could she be

156
00:06:49,430 --> 00:06:50,030
the original heroines?

157
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:50,800
Wait.

158
00:06:51,430 --> 00:06:53,000
What was her name again?

159
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:54,590
I think her surname was Song...

160
00:06:57,630 --> 00:06:58,800
I'm Song Zhang.

161
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:00,270
Greetings, Your Lordship.

162
00:07:08,420 --> 00:07:09,700
(Cheng)

163
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:12,120
This is indeed my jade pendant.

164
00:07:14,730 --> 00:07:16,350
When I found
Your Lordship injured years ago,

165
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:17,480
I didn't know who you were,

166
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:18,560
so I took the liberty of treating you.

167
00:07:18,950 --> 00:07:20,150
I haven't come to the Marquis's Manor

168
00:07:20,390 --> 00:07:22,010
to seek favor with the powerful.

169
00:07:22,750 --> 00:07:24,120
If my family hadn't
suddenly fallen on hard times,

170
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,350
I

171
00:07:25,510 --> 00:07:27,000
would never have dared come here
over that past encounter.

172
00:07:27,390 --> 00:07:28,320
I truly

173
00:07:30,190 --> 00:07:31,320
have nowhere else to turn.

174
00:07:42,270 --> 00:07:43,800
What an unfortunate young woman.

175
00:07:44,630 --> 00:07:45,360
Since you're

176
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:46,590
His Lordship's savior,

177
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:48,440
you may stay at the manor.

178
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:50,510
Thank you, Old Madam.

179
00:07:51,390 --> 00:07:52,350
Thank you, Your Lordship.

180
00:08:00,070 --> 00:08:00,560
This is

181
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:01,760
Yuyuan, the Wife of the Marquis's Heir.

182
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:02,950
And this is

183
00:08:02,950 --> 00:08:04,240
Shutiao, Third Madam.

184
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:05,350
The manor is now

185
00:08:05,630 --> 00:08:06,800
managed by the two of them.

186
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:09,390
(Why are they still alive?)

187
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:12,510
Who would have thought

188
00:08:12,630 --> 00:08:13,800
Yuyuan and Shutiao

189
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:14,560
would dare commit adultery?

190
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:15,510
Well,

191
00:08:15,580 --> 00:08:16,540
perhaps it's better that they're dead.

192
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:17,210
At least

193
00:08:17,210 --> 00:08:18,220
they won't disgrace the Marquis's Manor.

194
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:20,200
(In my previous life,
when I arrived at the Marquis's Manor,)

195
00:08:20,510 --> 00:08:22,320
(the position of the
Wife of the Marquis's Heir was vacant.)

196
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:24,150
(There was no one
managing the household.)

197
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:26,030
(Could something
have changed in this life?)

198
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:27,680
(I'd better test them.)

199
00:08:29,630 --> 00:08:31,000
I didn't expect the original heroine

200
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:32,400
to return so soon.

201
00:08:35,390 --> 00:08:37,110
Looks like the story is back on track.

202
00:08:37,790 --> 00:08:39,150
As expendable supporting characters,

203
00:08:39,150 --> 00:08:40,200
we should take the hint

204
00:08:40,750 --> 00:08:42,280
and pack up and leave soon.

205
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,280
Yuyuan, Shutiao,

206
00:09:00,870 --> 00:09:02,440
without your kindness,

207
00:09:02,790 --> 00:09:04,440
I wouldn't even have a place to stay.

208
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:06,040
To show my gratitude,

209
00:09:06,550 --> 00:09:07,400
I've reserved a table

210
00:09:07,750 --> 00:09:08,680
at Zuixian Restaurant.

211
00:09:09,270 --> 00:09:10,590
I hope you'll join me.

212
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,240
Why is she suddenly

213
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:14,950
inviting us to dinner?

214
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,710
Something feels a little off.

215
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:18,560
It is a bit strange.

216
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,750
But she's the heroine.

217
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:24,300
In the original novel,
she's almost unbelievably virtuous.

218
00:09:24,750 --> 00:09:26,280
There shouldn't be a problem.

219
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,710
Doesn't that interest you?

220
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,900
I heard their specialty is

221
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:33,800
thin slices of meat

222
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:35,280
grilled over charcoal,

223
00:09:35,910 --> 00:09:36,990
with seasonings
sprinkled on as they cook.

224
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:39,080
The aroma fills half the street.

225
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:41,230
Isn't that just barbecue?

226
00:09:41,910 --> 00:09:43,390
(For a life without worries...)

227
00:09:43,390 --> 00:09:44,800
(Have a little barbecue every day.)

228
00:09:45,170 --> 00:09:45,920
- Let's eat before we leave.
- Let's eat before we leave.

229
00:09:48,020 --> 00:09:48,980
(Mengxia, Rumeng, Die, He, Susu)

230
00:09:52,820 --> 00:09:55,620
(Third Prince)

231
00:10:01,630 --> 00:10:02,080
Your Highness,

232
00:10:02,220 --> 00:10:03,100
that dancing girl from the brothel

233
00:10:03,100 --> 00:10:03,750
has been dealt with.

234
00:10:04,030 --> 00:10:04,630
However,

235
00:10:04,630 --> 00:10:05,560
I searched her residence thoroughly

236
00:10:05,870 --> 00:10:06,520
and found nothing

237
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:07,990
related to the Battle of Qiyun Pass.

238
00:10:08,750 --> 00:10:09,870
Father will soon decide

239
00:10:09,870 --> 00:10:10,870
who becomes Crown Prince.

240
00:10:11,100 --> 00:10:11,900
(Shuang, Chuchu, Rou, Qiulan, Yunhe)

241
00:10:11,900 --> 00:10:12,720
I won't allow anyone

242
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:14,040
to use what happened back then

243
00:10:14,510 --> 00:10:16,440
to stand in the way
of my becoming Crown Prince.

244
00:10:18,870 --> 00:10:19,750
That dancing girl,

245
00:10:20,670 --> 00:10:21,320
I want her found,

246
00:10:22,270 --> 00:10:23,470
dead or alive.

247
00:10:23,740 --> 00:10:24,360
Yes, Your Highness.

248
00:10:25,870 --> 00:10:26,680
There's one more thing.

249
00:10:27,150 --> 00:10:28,030
At the scene,

250
00:10:28,030 --> 00:10:29,280
I spotted two familiar faces.

251
00:10:29,380 --> 00:10:31,140
- The two sons of Marquis Jingyuan.
- We leave together or not at all.

252
00:10:31,140 --> 00:10:32,400
Shen Cheng and Shen He.

253
00:10:32,910 --> 00:10:34,680
Why were they there?

254
00:10:35,040 --> 00:10:36,840
Could they have grown suspicious

255
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:37,920
about what happened at Qiyun Pass?

256
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,400
It seems I should

257
00:10:41,550 --> 00:10:43,160
put them to the test.

258
00:10:46,970 --> 00:10:49,290
♪No matter how
the universe changes tomorrow♪

259
00:10:49,290 --> 00:10:56,490
♪Right now,
I just want to stay by your side♪

260
00:10:56,490 --> 00:11:01,690
♪Let this kiss and this dream
last until we're old♪

261
00:11:02,890 --> 00:11:07,930
♪And hold on to all
the tenderness of this moment♪

262
00:11:09,290 --> 00:11:14,370
♪Following this heartbeat,
we'll retrace our steps♪

263
00:11:15,730 --> 00:11:20,850
♪As time goes by,
all I need is your gaze♪

264
00:11:22,130 --> 00:11:25,490
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪

265
00:11:44,250 --> 00:11:47,610
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪
